# What goes into the source archive on top of what setuptools takes by itself.
#
# The go/ directory is not a Python package, and without an explicit graft
# setuptools does not see it: that is exactly why the archive held zero Go files
# and the promise "it will build the native part itself" did not hold. The
# directory is filled in by .github/workflows/wheels.yml before the build; it is
# not in the repository tree.
graft go
recursive-include curlpro/profiles *.json
include LICENSE NOTICE py.typed
